{{end}}
Before you answer, check four things. The familiar thing is genuinely universal. Every "from" and every "to" is distinct, and no part of the picture is left pointing at nothing. There is a "breaks" beat and it names a real difference, not a hedge. And the narration fields together contain {{.MinWords}}-{{.MaxWords}} words, targeting {{.TargetWords}}.
